le=\"Undying Fury (Condition)\">Undying Fury</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until end of combat</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Cazador's anger increases his Strength score by 4 and lets him attack multiple times.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Cazador cannot cast spells while Undying Fury is active.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055931\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2576/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28801/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9664/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1242939/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n107.86%   61.317     30 Template:Trim